 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg5-00",
   "text": "这些路走不走得通，要看事发后的前 6 小时。",
   "spoken": "这些路走不走得通，要看事发后的前 6 小时。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg5-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 4.0,
   "speechStart": 1.695,
   "speechEnd": 5.396
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-01",
   "text": "发现异常，先暂停，协议暂停，交易所暂停这条链的提币。",
   "spoken": "发现异常，先暂停，协议暂停，交易所暂停这条链的提币。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg5-01.wav",
   "start": 5.82,
   "dur": 5.12,
   "speechStart": 5.82,
   "speechEnd": 10.734
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-02",
   "text": "接着整理地址清单，被盗地址，攻击者地址，已知的下一跳。",
   "spoken": "接着整理地址清单，被盗地址，攻击者地址，已知的下一跳。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg5-02.wav",
   "start": 11.16,
   "dur": 5.28,
   "speechStart": 11.16,
   "speechEnd": 16.235
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-03",
   "text": "清单是所有通知的前提，清单不准，冻结请求就会被拒绝或延误。",
   "spoken": "清单是所有通知的前提，清单不准，冻结请求就会被拒绝或延误。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg5-03.wav",
   "start": 16.66,
   "dur": 6.16,
   "speechStart": 16.66,
   "speechEnd": 22.587
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-04",
   "text": "然后并行通知，不是排队通知。",
   "spoken": "然后并行通知，不是排队通知。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg5-04.wav",
   "start": 23.04,
   "dur": 2.72,
   "speechStart": 23.136,
   "speechEnd": 25.558
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-05",
   "text": "稳定币发行方、交易所风控、跨链桥和兑换服务、SEAL 911 这样的应急网络、链上分析公司，同时发出去。",
   "spoken": "稳定币发行方、交易所风控、跨链桥和兑换服务、SEAL 911 这样的应急网络、链上分析公司，同时发出去。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg5-05.wav",
   "start": 25.98,
   "dur": 9.2,
   "speechStart": 26.076,
   "speechEnd": 34.981
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-06",
   "text": "先发清单，不要等完整报告，冻结只需要准确的地址和交易哈希。",
   "spoken": "先发清单，不要等完整报告，冻结只需要准确的地址和交易哈希。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg5-06.wav",
   "start": 35.4,
   "dur": 5.84,
   "speechStart": 35.4,
   "speechEnd": 41.039
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-07",
   "text": "同时做证据保全，交易哈希、日志、服务器镜像。",
   "spoken": "同时做证据保全，交易哈希、日志、服务器镜像。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg5-07.wav",
   "start": 41.46,
   "dur": 4.88,
   "speechStart": 41.46,
   "speechEnd": 46.202
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-08",
   "text": "保全要在清理和恢复系统之前完成，恢复会覆盖证据。",
   "spoken": "保全要在清理和恢复系统之前完成，恢复会覆盖证据。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg5-08.wav",
   "start": 46.56,
   "dur": 4.56,
   "speechStart": 46.66,
   "speechEnd": 50.887
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-09",
   "text": "然后报警，按辖区通知监管。",
   "spoken": "然后报警，按辖区通知监管。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg5-09.wav",
   "start": 51.34,
   "dur": 2.8,
   "speechStart": 51.438,
   "speechEnd": 53.964
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-10",
   "text": "一小时之后，可以在链上喊话，提出赏金和安全港条件，并且每小时更新地址清单。",
   "spoken": "一小时之后，可以在链上喊话，提出赏金和安全港条件，并且每小时更新地址清单。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg5-10.wav",
   "start": 54.36,
   "dur": 7.2,
   "speechStart": 54.455,
   "speechEnd": 61.314
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-11",
   "text": "安全港要事先写好。",
   "spoken": "安全港要事先写好。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg5-11.wav",
   "start": 61.78,
   "dur": 1.76,
   "speechStart": 61.877,
   "speechEnd": 63.312
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-12",
   "text": "SEAL 的白帽安全港框架，让协议通过治理事先授权白帽，在攻击正在发生时抢救资金。",
   "spoken": "SEAL 的白帽安全港框架，让协议通过治理事先授权白帽，在攻击正在发生时抢救资金。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg5-12.wav",
   "start": 63.76,
   "dur": 7.92,
   "speechStart": 63.76,
   "speechEnd": 71.478
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-13",
   "text": "默认条款是 72 小时内把资金返回指定地址，赏金 10%，上限 100 万美元。",
   "spoken": "默认条款是 72 小时内把资金返回指定地址，赏金 10%，上限 100 万美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg5-13.wav",
   "start": 71.9,
   "dur": 8.16,
   "speechStart": 71.996,
   "speechEnd": 79.887
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-14",
   "text": "事发时再讨论，白帽不敢动手。",
   "spoken": "事发时再讨论，白帽不敢动手。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg5-14.wav",
   "start": 80.28,
   "dur": 2.64,
   "speechStart": 80.28,
   "speechEnd": 82.724
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-15",
   "text": "平时也要准备。",
   "spoken": "平时也要准备。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg5-15.wav",
   "start": 83.14,
   "dur": 1.36,
   "speechStart": 83.14,
   "speechEnd": 84.269
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-16",
   "text": "实时监控大额流出和权限变更，风控名单每日更新，每季度演练一次，确认联系人是否有效。",
   "spoken": "实时监控大额流出和权限变更，风控名单每日更新，每季度演练一次，确认联系人是否有效。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg5-16.wav",
   "start": 84.72,
   "dur": 8.96,
   "speechStart": 84.72,
   "speechEnd": 93.503
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-17",
   "text": "聚类这类启发式追踪结论，要标注规则和置信度，不能单独作为冻结的依据。",
   "spoken": "聚类这类启发式追踪结论，要标注规则和置信度，不能单独作为冻结的依据。",
